Minimal, lightweight terminal for X with a tiny code base

st is a small terminal emulator for the X Window System from the suckless community. It aims to do one thing well, with very little code and no runtime configuration: settings are changed in the source before building. This is an unofficial AppImage build of st that runs on any Linux distribution.

- Very small and fast, with low memory use
- 256 colors and true color
- Unicode and wide character support
- Clipboard handling and mouse selection
- Works with any X11 window manager
